<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The undersigned holder of
the attached warrant (the &ldquo;<B>Warrant</B>&rdquo;) hereby exercises the right to purchase in respect of _________________ Ordinary
Shares (&ldquo;<B>Warrant Shares</B>&rdquo;) of HUB Cyber Security Ltd., an Israeli company (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;). Capitalized
terms used herein and not otherwise defined shall have the respective meanings set forth in the Warrant.</P>

